        "text": "Page: National Weather Service Topeka, Kansas. Sentence: National Weather Service – Topeka, Kansas (Abbreviation TOP) is a local National Weather Service forecast office based in Topeka, the state capital of Kansas.\nPage: National Weather Service Topeka, Kansas. Sentence: Its offices are located near Philip Billard Municipal Airport.\nPage: National Weather Service Topeka, Kansas. Sentence: Communities that rely on the Topeka Weather Office for forecasts and severe storm warnings include Abilene, Clay Center, Concordia, Council Grove, Emporia, Hiawatha, Junction City, Lawrence, Manhattan, Marysville, Ottawa, and Topeka.\nPage: Council Grove, Kansas. Sentence: Council Grove is a city and county seat in Morris County, Kansas, United States.\nPage: Council Grove, Kansas. Sentence: It was named after an agreement between European Americans and the Osage Nation about allowing settlers' wagon trains to pass through the area and proceed to the West.",
